{"id":"bc42a885-3ba8-42d6-a37a-29170020049c","object":"chat.completion","created":1784821063,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"implementation\": \"import heapq\\ndef solve(case):\\n    nodes = case['nodes']\\n    threshold = case['utility_threshold']\\n    node_map = {node['id']: node for node in nodes}\\n    children = {node['id']: [] for node in nodes}\\n    for node in nodes:\\n        parent = node['parent']\\n        if parent is not None:\\n            children[parent].append(node['id'])\\n    heap = []\\n    for node in nodes:\\n        heapq.heappush(heap, (-node['depth'], node['id'], node))\\n    removed = set()\\n    visit_order = []\\n    while heap:\\n        neg_depth, nid, node = heapq.heappop(heap)\\n        visit_order.append(nid)\\n        if nid in removed:\\n            continue\\n        is_leaf = True\\n        for child_id in children.get(nid, []):\\n            if child_id not in removed:\\n                is_leaf = False\\n                break\\n        if not is_leaf:\\n            continue\\n        if node['removable'] and node['utility'] <= threshold:\\n            removed.add(nid)\\n            parent_id = node['parent']\\n            if parent_id is not None and parent_id not in removed:\\n                parent_node = node_map[parent_id]\\n                heapq.heappush(heap, (-parent_node['depth'], parent_id, parent_node))\\n    retained = [node['id'] for node in nodes if node['id'] not in removed]\\n    return {'retained_ids': retained, 'visit_order': visit_order}\"}","reasoning_content":"We need to produce a JSON object with key \"implementation\" containing Python source code for `solve(case)`. The problem: \"Maintain and update the syntax-guided reduction work queue across accepted and rejected tree rewrites without revisiting invalidated nodes.\" Given test cases with nodes, each node has id, parent, symbol, depth, removable, utility. Also utility_threshold. The task: \